  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right)(10) B=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}4 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -5 & 0 & \\alpha \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{array}\\right)$. If $B$",
